<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said.</p>
<p>Inquiry moderate, demand light. For the week to date 12,700 cattle including 10,500 head previously contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
